From abe3b6b7390788db396130d45aa231e68048f15e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Tekriwal, Tanuj" <tanuj.tekriwal@intel.corp-partner.google.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 05:34:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix build errors as per A17 build rules

The source tree is mounted read-only, so touch warn_local_module_tags
and touch publish_gptimage_var fail at the workspace root. Both need
their outputs redirected to out/.

Tracked-On: NA
Signed-off-by: Tekriwal, Tanuj <tanuj.tekriwal@intel.corp-partner.google.com>
---
